  "body": "I self-host Synapse server with no federation on it.\r\n\r\nI've noticed the following lines in the logs however:\r\n```\r\n2023-09-29T14:29:54.000Z 2023-09-29 14:29:54,430 - synapse.http.matrixfederationclient - 348 - INFO - federation_transaction_transmission_loop-298 - {PUT-O-316} [matrix.org] Completed request: 200 OK in 0.04 secs, got 11 bytes - PUT matrix-federation://matrix.org/_matrix/federation/v1/send/<...>\r\n\r\n2023-09-29T14:40:43.000Z 2023-09-29 14:40:43,369 - synapse.federation.sender.transaction_manager - 121 - INFO - federation_transaction_transmission_loop-299 - TX [matrix.org] {<...>} Sending transaction [<...>], (PDUs: 0, EDUs: 1)\r\n```\r\n\r\nI believe that I missed something - how can I make sure that my server is not sending anything anywhere?",
